# Prose. Prettier reflows Markdown paragraphs, and AGENTS.md / DESIGN.md are written
# with deliberate line breaks that carry meaning in the diff — a reflowed paragraph
# turns a one-word edit into a twelve-line change.
*.md

# The same reasoning, but load-bearing rather than cosmetic. `test/fixtures/mdx-sink.mdx`
# exists to prove what `mdx::prepass` does to particular byte sequences: a multi-line
# component, a JSX block containing a fence, prose with backticks in it. Prettier
# collapsed the first onto one line, added semicolons inside the fence, and reflowed the
# backticks out of the third — quietly turning the fixture into a test of something else.
*.mdx
